/**
 * Loop Run coordinator.
 *
 * One instance per {@link ralphLoop} invocation. Owns the lifecycle of a
 * single run as the sole authoritative writer of the Durable Loop Run
 * Tracker, and announces past-tense facts to in-process subscribers after
 * each atomic write succeeds.
 *
 * See ADR-0007. The coordinator is introduced under a strangler migration:
 * methods are added here as joints are ported from `ralphLoop`. Initial
 * surface covers task phase transitions, scheduler progress, whole-run
 * review phase, and run completion. Snapshot/rollback and panic-undo
 * orchestration are part of the planned vocabulary in
 * `./events.ts` and will be added as those joints are rewired.
 */

